  "_comment": "Italian (it) string bundle for the Python board UI. Any key omitted here falls back to the English source in en.json. Keep every key that en.json defines translated so no English leaks into the Italian UI (guarded by test_i18n). Informal tu, matching Lichess's Italian interface. Chess vocabulary a player expects: donna, alfiere, cavallo, torre, pedone, scacco, scacco matto, stallo, patta. Colour labels are nominative Bianchi/Neri, so lichess.started and game.resign_color name the side rather than governing the colour. Counted seconds use the s symbol because board t() has no plural mechanism. Lines on the 128px panel are kept short and broken with an explicit newline rather than abbreviated.",
